      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Overview",
      "anchor": "overview"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Mayomayo on Malangdo adds extra stats to some high-end weapons."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "It works on many high-end weapons, including level 4 weapons, and is the standard enchant system for improving a weapon."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Required Materials",
      "anchor": "material"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "[ITEM:6423|Seagod's Anger]"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "The weapon to enchant"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Enchant Options",
      "anchor": "option"
    },
    {
      "type": "notice",
      "title": "Recommended Enchant",
      "text": "On the NEED server, the Seagod's Anger enchant is recommended over the A~E Grade Coin enchants in most cases."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Depending on the weapon type, the Seagod's Anger enchant gives useful options such as ATK, ASPD and MATK."
    },
